abstract: >-
  Egyptian is a fork based on Mayan EDMS 4.x, an open-source electronic
  document management system. It adds security and bug fixes that are not
  yet merged upstream. "Mayan EDMS" is a registered trademark of Roberto
  Rosario; Egyptian is not affiliated with, or endorsed by, the Mayan EDMS
  project or its trademark holder.
